@startuml
title SD06 - Adaptive What Should I Study Next?
actor Student
participant AgentController as UI
participant StudyAgentFacade as Facade
participant AgentCoordinator as Coord
participant HistoryTool as HistoryTool
participant LearningHistoryService as History
participant ProgressTool as ProgressTool
participant ProgressService as Progress
participant StudyPlanTool as PlanTool
participant StudyPlanService as Plans
participant RecommendationService as Recommendation
Student -> UI: askWhatShouldStudyNext(course)
UI -> Facade: ask(request)
Facade -> Coord: coordinate(request)
Coord -> ProgressTool: execute(context)
ProgressTool -> Progress: findWeakTopics(courseId)
Coord -> PlanTool: execute(context)
PlanTool -> Plans: currentPlan(courseId)
Coord -> HistoryTool: execute(context)
HistoryTool -> History: findRelevantHistory(courseId)
Coord -> Recommendation: recommendNextStep(progress, plan, history)
Recommendation --> Coord: recommendation and explanation
Coord --> UI: next action
@enduml
